OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Labour councillors make switch
OL,4,Ato Green Party
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Luton borough councillors who quit
OL,7,FLabour to become part of an Independent
OL,8,FAlliance Group have now joined the
OL,9,FGreen Party.
OL,11,FIt means Yarun Begum and Rumi Chowdhury
OL,12,Fare the town's first Green councillors,
OL,13,Falthough they will also remain part of
OL,14,Fthat Independent Alliance.
OL,16,FA Green Party spokesperson said: "The
OL,17,Fmove establishes Green representation
OL,18,Fon the local authority for the first
OL,19,Ftime, during a period of major change
OL,20,Fin the council's political make-up."
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
