OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Labour councillors make switch
OL,4,Ato Green Party
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new leader of Luton Council, Lib
OL,7,FDem Amjid Ali said: "Under the
OL,8,Fcoalition standing orders, each group
OL,9,Fhas autonomy as to how they manage
OL,10,Ftheir own group. Their move bears no
OL,11,Fimpact on the Lib Dem-led coalition."
